OL,4,CMore young hikers lost using Google    
OL,5,CMaps, say rescuers                     
OL,6,GMore young people are getting caught   
OL,7,Gout on the fells due to relying on     
OL,8,GGoogle Maps for navigation, rescuers   
OL,9,Ghave said.                             
OL,11,FAfter a full-team rescue on Sunday,    
OL,12,FWasdale Mountain Rescue Team (WMRT)    
OL,13,Fsaid an increasing amount of young     
OL,14,Fpeople, mostly aged 18 to 24, were     
OL,15,Fgetting lost or into trouble after     
OL,16,Fusing Google Maps on their phones.     
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
