OL,4,CGirl, 17, dies in crash and three      
OL,5,Cothers badly hurt                      
OL,6,GA 17-year-old girl has died and three  
OL,7,Gothers seriously injured in a crash    
OL,8,Gbetween two cars.                      
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said   
OL,11,Fthe collision happened at about 16:00  
OL,12,FGMT on Thursday in Lower Seedley Road, 
OL,13,FSalford.                               
OL,15,FA force spokesperson said the          
OL,16,Fteenager, who died in hospital after   
OL,17,Fthe crash, had been a passenger in a   
OL,18,Fcar modified for people with           
OL,19,Fadditional needs.                      
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
