OL,4,CMP 'deeply concerned' by BAE plan to   
OL,5,Ccut 1,000 jobs                         
OL,6,GAn MP has said he is "deeply           
OL,7,Gconcerned" over plans by Britain's     
OL,8,Glargest defence contractor, BAE        
OL,9,GSystems, to cut about 1,000 members of 
OL,10,Gstaff.                                 
OL,12,FBAE said it planned to cut up to 1,070 
OL,13,Fstaff members from its head office and 
OL,14,Fair sector, across its sites in Warton 
OL,15,Fand Samlesbury in Lancashire, Frimley  
OL,16,Fin Surrey and London, to ensure the    
OL,17,Ffirm remained "efficient, agile and    
OL,18,Faffordable".                           
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
